ddressing  the overall situation with growing an  airline  rapidly i think we quickly recovered our  brand  so the major takeaways for me are to  communicate you almost  can't over communicate the second one is  there's an impact of any of these kinds  of events on your brand  we had to really think about you know  how do we make sure that customers trust  us again  to me the most important thing for  managers is to remain  calm to listen to be thoughtful not to  lose it not to be frantic  you need to deal it with it seriously  these are important events  but how you manage them how you behave  will really be recalled long after the  event
 

